able itemsImproved inventory to include previously missing itemsFixed collision working improperly on some objects & itemsFixed certain places where player could go out of boundsAdded more detailed names & description","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T19:14:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067937090","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4933610-1846018067929767","game_id":"steam-4933610","kind":"update","title":"⚠️ DUAT Demo — Known Issues & Upcoming Update","summary":"Thank you to everyone who has played the DUAT Demo and shared their feedback with us!We have received valuable feedback from players and are currently aware of several issues in the current version of the demo.Known Issues:• Some areas are missing collision/barriers, which may allow players to leave the intended area.• The current interaction system can be difficult to use, as some objects require the player to stand very close to them.• Some puzzles and doors do not provide enough guidance, mak","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T13:51:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929767","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4933610":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:35:17Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:35:17Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4933610":"2026-10-26T15:35:17Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4933610":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:35:17Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:35:17Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:35:17Z"},"5320800":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:35:17Z","last_success_at":"202